#. type: Title ####
#: README.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable DNS for l10n site"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once a localized site has enough of its content translated, DNS needs to be enabled. To do that get one of the Red Hat admins to submit\n"
"a ticket to IT asking for XX domain:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block
#: README.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We need a CNAME record set up for XX.quarkus.io to have it serve out GitHub pages.\n"
"\n"
"The CNAME record for XX.quarkus.io should point to \"quarkusio.github.io.\".\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "See Step 5 on https://docs.github.com/en/github/working-with-github-pages/managing-a-custom-domain-for-your-github-pages-site for more information.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: README.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Quarkus theme in your site"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:116
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The look of quarkus.io (layout, header and navigation, footers, colours and light/dark modes) is available as a\n"
"[Roq](https://iamroq.dev/) theme, so other Roq sites, such as the localized sites, can look like quarkus.io.\n"
"Its sources are in [`theme/`](theme/), and it is published in a Maven repository at https://quarkus.io/maven/.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: README.md:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the repository and the theme to your site's `pom.xml`:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```xml\n"
"    <repositories>\n"
"        <repository>\n"
"            <id>quarkus-website</id>\n"
"            <url>https://quarkus.io/maven/</url>\n"
"            <snapshots><enabled>true</enabled></snapshots>\n"
"        </repository>\n"
"    </repositories>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:136
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```xml\n"
"    <dependency>\n"
"        <groupId>io.quarkus</groupId>\n"
"        <artifactId>quarkus-website-theme</artifactId>\n"
"        <version>1.0.0-SNAPSHOT</version>\n"
"    </dependency>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: README.md:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the theme's `base` layout for your pages:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:146
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```html\n"
"    ---\n"
"    layout: base\n"
"    title: My page\n"
"    ---\n"
"    <h1>{=page.title}</h1>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: README.md:148
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the theme styles to a stylesheet in your site's `web/` directory (e.g. `web/style.scss`):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:152
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```scss\n"
"    @use \"quarkus-theme\";\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:155
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The theme styles are not bundled on their own, so that you decide where they go relative to your own styles:\n"
"    usually first, so your styles can build on them, as quarkus.io does at the top of [`web/main.scss`](web/main.scss).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: README.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Describe your footer in `projectfooter.yaml` (footer text and links), in your site's data directory. Start from\n"
"quarkus.io's [`_data/projectfooter.yaml`](_data/projectfooter.yaml). The menus are part of the theme, so they are\n"
"the same on every site using it, and their links point at https://quarkus.io/. (quarkus.io and the localized sites\n"
"built from this repository set `quarkus-website-theme.links-url=/` in `config/application.properties`, so their\n"
"menu links stay on the site, e.g. ja.quarkus.io/about.)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: README.md:164
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optionally, customize the layout by overriding its `lang`, `head`, `header`, `footer` or `scripts` sections in your\n"
"own `templates/layouts/base.html`, as quarkus.io does in [`templates/layouts/base.html`](templates/layouts/base.html):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:170
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```html\n"
"    ---\n"
"    theme-layout: base\n"
"    ---\n"
"    {#insert /}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:175
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {#footer}\n"
"    {#include partials/quarkus/footer-minimal.html /}\n"
"    {/footer}\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:178
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[`theme/example-minimal-site/`](theme/example-minimal-site/) is a complete minimal site using the theme, and [`theme/README.md`](theme/README.md)\n"
"has more details, including how to work on the theme itself.\n"
msgstr ""

